{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年、本当にたくさんの経験をさせていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobZdxLPY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobVjQZ6z.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobQrn9zx.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobKuwo0w.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobhXmQJX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この枚数では収まりきらない\nもっともっとたくさんあります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この一年、早いような遅いような\n感じたことのない時間の流れでした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分の不甲斐なさ、不器用さ、弱さ、申し訳なさに足を取られ転びそうになって\nなんとか転ばないように手を伸ばしたら、誰かがいてくれて伸ばした手を掴んでくれて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今までは手を伸ばしてもその先には何もなかったから、それに感動して"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は今、幸せな場所に置いてもらっていることを改めて実感します。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "溢れんばかりのあたたかさ、優しさを心で触れて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "涙をいっぱい流して"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "新しい感情を知って"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この一年で出会えた人、もの\n全部大切に収めてこれからも頑張ります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして\n松尾さん、矢久保さん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽屋で笑いながらお話ししているのをよくお見かけしました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "周りを笑顔にしてくださるお二人を近くで見させてもらえて、とても感謝しています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだちょっとあるので、少しでもお話できたら嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めまして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年一年本当にありがとうございました。\n出会えて嬉しかったよ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年もよろしくお願いいたします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん良いお年をお迎えください〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉"}], "source": "official"}